00:39:14,716 --> 00:39:16,196
Mari kita beri pencahayaan pada wajah.

625
00:39:16,196 --> 00:39:18,678
Silakan geser reflektor sedikit ke kiri.

626
00:39:18,678 --> 00:39:20,013
Apakah posisi ini sudah tepat?

627
00:39:20,013 --> 00:39:22,340
Ya, sebentar.

628
00:39:32,359 --> 00:39:34,899
Gerakkan kepala Anda sedikit ke kiri.

629
00:39:34,899 --> 00:39:36,471
Apakah kita perlu sedikit menyesuaikan lampu kunci?

630
00:39:36,471 --> 00:39:37,519
Maaf?

631
00:39:37,519 --> 00:39:39,632
Oh ya, ya.

632
00:39:41,442 --> 00:39:43,934
Sedikit lebih ke kanan.

633
00:39:54,923 --> 00:39:56,842
Halo semuanya.

634
00:39:56,842 --> 00:39:59,489
- Halo.
- Halo.

635
00:39:59,489 --> 00:40:00,799
Bagaimana pengaturan pencahayaannya?

636
00:40:00,799 --> 00:40:01,930
Semua sudah siap.

637
00:40:01,930 --> 00:40:04,865
Lampu kunci terkunci.

638
00:40:04,865 --> 00:40:06,691
Siapa kamu?

639
