00:42:09,535 --> 00:42:10,782
Menyukai...

675
00:42:10,782 --> 00:42:14,289
Pemotretan sampul Tesser tahun 2018.

676
00:42:15,407 --> 00:42:16,683
Jadi...

677
00:42:16,683 --> 00:42:19,943
Kamu mengubah sesuatu tanpa arahanku?

678
00:42:21,287 --> 00:42:23,322
Aku tahu kau membencinya...

679
00:42:23,322 --> 00:42:25,569
- ketika orang-orang melewati batas di lokasi syuting.
